@copilot Update this existing PR directly. The user requested: "New class-loader tests - remove these".

Remove the newly added handlerMappingFilterApplicationVisible() test method from both SpringBootBasedTest.java files under instrumentation/spring/spring-webmvc/spring-webmvc-3.1/javaagent/src/test/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/spring/webmvc/v3_1/boot/ and instrumentation/spring/spring-webmvc/spring-webmvc-6.0/javaagent/src/test/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/spring/webmvc/v6_0/boot/. Remove the org.springframework.web.servlet.DispatcherServlet imports that become unused.

Keep the existing handlerMappingFilterResourceAvailable() tests and their relocated resource paths. Preserve the filter package moves, class-name/resource registrations, null-request guards, and all other existing changes. Do not replace the removed tests with new class-loader tests or make unrelated changes. Run the relevant focused validation.
